reservation R0001). This was the cheapest nonstop flight. A $199 flight was available, but it has a stop.\n- **Hotel: Midtown Lodge (H1)**, New York, 2 nights checking in 2026-11-12, $189/night, $378 total (reservation R0002). This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total: $667**, charged to the corporate card. That's under the $1000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\nI tried to book both together with `book_trip`, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had been booked and the hotel hadn't. Rather than retry `book_trip` and risk paying for the flight twice, I booked the hotel on its own, then checked again to confirm both bookings.", "type": "text"}]}]}